          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c1_self_driving_policies_learned_behavi",
          "text": "\"Self-driving policies learned by behavioral cloning are usually trained open-loop, matching expert actions one step at a time, yet they are deployed closed-loop where every action shapes future states.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "self-driving",
