        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_authors_ask_simpler_question_get",
          "text": "The authors ask a simpler question: can we get closed-loop benefits by only using a simulator to decide which training scenes matter, without changing the loss function or requiring differentiability? That question motivates CW-ERM.\"",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
