          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s07_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c1_results_strong_compared_against_best",
          "text": "\"The results are strong. Compared against the best baseline, behavioral cloning with ERM and perturbation, CW-ERM significantly reduces collisions across the board, with improvements reaching about thirty-five percent on some metrics.",
