          "chunk_id": "s07_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c3_when_upsamples_side_collision_scenes",
          "text": "When it upsamples side-collision scenes, side collisions fall from fifty-five to forty-seven. There is a nice side effect too: improving one metric often improves related ones.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
