          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c4_upsampling_side_collisions_also_redu",
          "text": "Upsampling side collisions also reduces rear collisions, evidence that the policy is becoming less passive rather than just gaming a single number. Variance is also lower than the baseline in several cases, so the gains are stable.\"",
